  "instructions": [
    "Heat ghee in a large pan over medium heat.",
    "Add cumin seeds and let them sizzle for a few seconds.",
    "Add chopped onion and cook until it is translucent.",
    "Add minced garlic and grated ginger and cook for another minute.",
    "Add shredded Chinese cabbage and cook until it is slightly wilted.",
    "Add basmati rice and stir to combine with the cabbage mixture.",
    "Add coriander powder and salt, and stir to combine.",
    "Transfer the mixture to a scallop shell vessel and serve hot.",
    "Garnish with fresh cilantro leaves and serve immediately."
